tination safely and on time.",[],{"type":88,"text":96,"spans":97,"direction":91},"Whether it's the skyscrapers of New York City, the wide-open spaces of Texas, or the star-studded boulevards of California, trust us to deliver your parcels quickly and affordably throughout the USA.",[98,105,107,112,113,118],{"start":99,"end":100,"type":101,"data":102},32,45,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":103,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fnew-york","_blank",{"start":99,"end":100,"type":106},"strong",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":101,"data":110},71,76,{"link_type":36,"url":111,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Ftexas",{"start":108,"end":109,"type":106},{"start":114,"end":115,"type":101,"data":116},112,122,{"link_type":36,"url":117,"target":104},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcalifornia",{"start":114,"end":119,"type":106},124,"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":123,"version":31,"items":124,"primary":144,"id":157,"slice_type":158,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[125,130,134,139],{"column_1_cell":126,"column_2_cell":127,"column_3_cell":128,"column_4_cell":129},"250g","£12.17","£10.89","£1.28",{"column_1_cell":131,"column_2_cell":132,"column_3_cell":128,"column_4_cell":133},"500g","£14.25","£3.36",{"column_1_cell":135,"column_2_cell":136,"column_3_cell":137,"column_4_cell":138},"1kg","£17.53","£15.79","£1.74",{"column_1_cell":140,"column_2_cell":141,"column_3_cell":142,"column_4_cell":143},"2kg","£20.20","£18.19","£2.01",{"SectionTitle":145,"SectionSubtitle":146,"TableFooter":147,"InformationTableButtonUrl":148,"InformationTableButtonText":151,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":152,"column_name_1":153,"column_name_2":154,"column_name_3":155,"column_name_4":156},"Postage to USA","When sending parcels to the USA, you’ll always receive great service at a low price with Evri. Plus, you can send parcels internationally up to 15kg. See how cheap it is to send a parcel to the USA based on some of our more popular weights:","*Royal Mail prices quoted are for an International Tracked delivery of a small 1kg parcel to the USA vs a tracked Evri parcel of the same weight. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fprices2026 on 14\u002F05\u002F2026. Other features of the services, including transit times and compensation levels, will differ. Different terms and conditions will apply.",{"link_type":36,"key":149,"url":150},"6418d52a-370b-4ac9-80d4-e6453a7c7d5d","\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to the USA",true,"Weight","Royal Mail","Evri","Savings","information_table_v2$f0928313-7115-403a-bfec-41d1928208c4","information_table_v2",{"variation":160,"version":31,"items":161,"primary":163,"id":228,"slice_type":121,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[162],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":164,"CardText":165,"ButtonText":225,"ButtonUrl":226,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled public holidays in the USA",[166,169,175,180,185,190,195,200,204,209,213,218,222],{"type":88,"text":167,"spans":168,"direction":91},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination without delay, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":170,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":91},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[173],{"start":65,"end":174,"type":106},14,{"type":170,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":91},"Martin Luther King Jr Day – 19\u002F01\u002F2026",[178],{"start":65,"end":179,"type":106},26,{"type":170,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":91},"Presidents’ Day – 16\u002F02\u002F2026",[183],{"start":65,"end":184,"type":106},15,{"type":170,"text":186,"spans":187,"direction":91},"Memorial Day – 25\u002F05\u002F2026",[188],{"start":65,"end":189,"type":106},11,{"type":170,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":91},"Juneteenth – 19\u002F06\u002F2026",[193],{"start":65,"end":194,"type":106},10,{"type":170,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":91},"Independence Day – 04\u002F07\u002F2026",[198],{"start":65,"end":199,"type":106},16,{"type":170,"text":201,"spans":202,"direction":91},"Labour Day – 02\u002F09\u002F2026",[203],{"start":65,"end":189,"type":106},{"type":170,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":91},"Indigenous Peoples’ Day\u002FColumbus Day – 12\u002F10\u002F2026",[207],{"start":65,"end":208,"type":106},36,{"type":170,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":91},"Veterans’ Day – 11\u002F11\u002F2026",[212],{"start":65,"end":174,"type":106},{"type":170,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":91},"Thanksgiving – 26\u002F11\u002F2026",[216],{"start":65,"end":217,"type":106},12,{"type":170,"text":219,"spans":220,"direction":91},"Christmas – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[221],{"start":65,"end":189,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":223,"spans":224,"direction":91},"It’s also important to be aware of local holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],"Send a parcel",{"link_type":36,"key":227,"url":150},"027f46cb-13a7-4419-a5c1-77104549eab2","card$d590c818-c9ce-4fd6-a97b-18212c99f2cf",{"variation":230,"version":31,"items":231,"primary":295,"id":306,"slice_type":307,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[232,255,275],{"Title":233,"Description":238,"Image":242,"Label":46,"UrlText":236,"Url":250,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":253,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[234],{"type":235,"text":236,"spans":237},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[239],{"type":88,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":91},"Book online and drop off your parcel at your local ParcelShop. You can use our handy Print in ParcelShop devices to print your postage label for free. If you prefer to book in person, why not visit one of our 3,000+ Post Offices?",[],{"dimensions":243,"alt":245,"copyright":46,"url":246,"id":247,"edit":248},{"width":77,"height":244},665,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","usa.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":249,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},462,{"link_type":36,"key":251,"url":252},"dab66002-a66b-4064-a063-7ae73f61e94a","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":254},"Any",{"Title":256,"Description":260,"Image":264,"Label":46,"UrlText":258,"Url":271,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":274,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[257],{"type":235,"text":258,"spans":259},"Lockers",[],[261],{"type":88,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":91},"Package up your items, book your delivery and take your parcel to your nearest Locker. Simply scan your barcode, pop your parcel into an available Locker and you’re good to go. ",[],{"dimensions":265,"alt":266,"copyright":46,"url":267,"id":268,"edit":269},{"width":77,"height":244},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","usa.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":65,"y":270,"zoom":66,"background":67},8,{"link_type":36,"key":272,"url":273},"7c43dedc-b66c-4d5b-bf95-691e0fa240fa","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":254},{"Title":276,"Description":280,"Image":284,"Label":46,"UrlText":290,"Url":291,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":294,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[277],{"type":235,"text":278,"spans":279},"Couriers",[],[281],{"type":88,"text":282,"spans":283,"direction":91},"Arrange for a courier collection from your home or office on a convenient day for a door-to-door service. We'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us.",[],{"dimensions":285,"alt":286,"copyright":46,"url":287,"id":288,"edit":289},{"width":77,"height":244},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is signing a blue slip. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","usa.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10213.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp",{"x":65,"y":270,"zoom":66,"background":67},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":292,"url":293},"268c743c-4015-4ff2-a28f-e4af5dfd8649","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":254},{"SectionTitle":296,"SectionDescription":301,"theme":305},[297],{"type":298,"text":299,"spans":300,"direction":91},"heading2","How to send parcels to the USA",[],[302],{"type":88,"text":303,"spans":304},"There are three methods for shipping from the UK to the USA with Evri:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":123,"version":31,"items":309,"primary":311,"id":336,"slice_type":121,"slice_label":46},[310],{},{"CardImage":312,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":318,"CardText":319,"ButtonText":333,"ButtonUrl":334,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":313,"alt":314,"copyright":46,"url":315,"id":316,"edit":317},{"width":77,"height":244},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","usa.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":65,"y":270,"zoom":66,"background":67},"Sending multiple parcels to the USA",[320,323,327,330],{"type":88,"text":321,"spans":322,"direction":91},"Our bulk integrations tool makes it quicker and easier to book multiple parcels at once – ideal if you’re running a busy e-commerce business that frequently ships across the pond:",[],{"type":324,"text":325,"spans":326,"direction":91},"o-list-item"," Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":324,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":91},"Package up your items, book your deliveries in one go, and print off your postage label at home or in-store for free",[],{"type":324,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":91},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":335,"url":38},"df0b6ff7-36e5-4caa-998f-7ecfd618af69","card$fa303a60-84d8-4787-b754-15518974d525",{"variation":338,"version":31,"items":339,"primary":419,"id":422,"slice_type":423,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[340,359,371,383,395,407],{"title":341,"content":342,"icon":352},"Regular tracking updates",[343],{"type":88,"text":344,"spans":345,"direction":91},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[346,351],{"start":347,"end":348,"type":101,"data":349},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":350,"target":104},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":347,"end":348,"type":106},{"dimensions":353,"alt":355,"copyright":46,"url":356,"id":357,"edit":358},{"width":354,"height":354},40,"Phone icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":360,"content":361,"icon":365},"Parcel cover",[362],{"type":88,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":366,"alt":367,"copyright":46,"url":368,"id":369,"edit":370},{"width":354,"height":354},"Money icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":83},{"title":372,"content":373,"icon":377},"Customs made easier",[374],{"type":88,"text":375,"spans":376,"direction":91},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":378,"alt":379,"copyright":46,"url":380,"id":381,"edit":382},{"width":354,"height":354},"Passport icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":83},{"title":384,"content":385,"icon":389},"Flexible printing options",[386],{"type":88,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":91},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":390,"alt":391,"copyright":46,"url":392,"id":393,"edit":394},{"width":354,"height":354},"Printer icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":83},{"title":396,"content":397,"icon":401},"Bulk send",[398],{"type":88,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":91},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":402,"alt":403,"copyright":46,"url":404,"id":405,"edit":406},{"width":354,"height":354},"Laptop icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":408,"content":409,"icon":413},"Trusted by top UK brands",[410],{"type":88,"text":411,"spans":412,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":414,"alt":415,"copyright":46,"url":416,"id":417,"edit":418},{"width":354,"height":354},"Success icon","usa.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"theme":420,"title":421,"description":46},"standard","Why send parcels to the USA with Evri?","list_block$87389633-8af1-4da5-9f55-ee48a27248cd","list_block",{"variation":160,"version":31,"items":425,"primary":427,"id":454,"slice_type":121,"slice_label":46},[426],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":428,"CardText":429,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":453,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to the USA",[430,438],{"type":88,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":91},"While you can send lots of items to the USA with Evri, there are a few limitations. Check out our full breakdown of what you can and can’t send internationally for the latest information. ",[433,437],{"start":434,"end":435,"type":101,"data":436},116,143,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":104},{"start":434,"end":435,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":91},"You should also follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels to the USA via airlines.",[441,446,447,452],{"start":442,"end":443,"type":101,"data":444},27,59,{"link_type":36,"url":445,"target":104},"usa.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":442,"end":443,"type":106},{"start":448,"end":449,"type":101,"data":450},68,95,{"link_type":36,"url":451,"target":104},"usa.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":448,"end":449,"type":106},{"link_type":254},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":160,"version":31,"items":456,"primary":458,"id":501,"slice_type":121,"slice_label":46},[457],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":459,"CardText":460,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":500,"IsEco":20},"The best address format for sending parcels to the USA",[461,464,467,470,473,476,479,483,487,492,497],{"type":88,"text":462,"spans":463},"When you send a parcel to the US, you'll need to follow the correct address structure:",[],{"type":170,"text":465,"spans":466},"The recipient's name",[],{"type":170,"text":468,"spans":469},"The house number and street name ",[],{"type":170,"text":471,"spans":472},"The city, state, and at least the first half of the ZIP code in capital letters. ",[],{"type":170,"text":474,"spans":475},"\"UNITED STATES OF AMERICA\" in capital letters on the last line of the address. You can also use the abbreviation \"USA\". ",[],{"type":88,"text":477,"spans":478},"For example:",[],{"type":88,"text":480,"spans":481},"Mr J. Bloggs",[482],{"start":65,"end":217,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":484,"spans":485},"308 Low Street",[486],{"start":65,"end":174,"type":106},{"type":88,"text":488,"spans":489},"FORT WAYNE, IN 46806",[490],{"start":65,"end":491,"type":106},20,{"type":88,"text":493,"spans":494},"USA",[495],{"start":65,"end":496,"type":106},3,{"type":88,"text":498,"spans":499},"Don’t worry, as long as you have the address information above, our automated address tool will do all the work for you and produce a label for your parcel in the right format.",[],{"link_type":254},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":123,"version":31,"items":503,"primary":547,"id":549,"slice_type":550,"slice_label":46},[504,510,528],{"questionTitle":505,"questionBody":506},"How long will my parcel take to be delivered to the USA?",[507],{"type":88,"text":508,"spans":509,"direction":91},"The estimated time of delivery for sending parcels to the USA is 7-12 working days using our Standard service.",[],{"questionTitle":511,"questionBody":512},"Will I need to deal with customs when sending a parcel to the USA?",[513,516,519],{"type":88,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":91},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":88,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":91},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":88,"text":520,"spans":521,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[522,527],{"start":523,"end":524,"type":101,"data":525},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":526,"target":104},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":523,"end":524,"type":106},{"questionTitle":529,"questionBody":530},"Is there import tax from the UK to the USA?",[531,534,537,540],{"type":88,"text":532,"spans":533,"direction":91},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":535,"spans":536,"direction":91},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":538,"spans":539,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":88,"text":520,"spans":541,"direction":91},[542,545],{"start":543,"end":524,"type":101,"data":544},37,{"link_type":36,"url":526,"target":104},{"start":543,"end":546,"type":106},66,{"title":548},"FAQs about sending parcels to the USA","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_questions",[29,70,122,159,229,308,337,424,455,502],["Reactive",553],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":554,"$sclients":619,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":622},{"abtasty":555,"accessibe":558,"appPromoBanner":561,"autoDivertUpdates":564,"awin":567,"bulkInternational":570,"bulkSendEnabled":573,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":576,"enableBasketCount":579,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":582,"euCustomsDuty":585,"groovyAdvert":588,"newI